\pard\sb400\sa300
{\f0\fs36\b\cf2 Summary}
\par
\pard\sb0\sa200
{\f0\fs24\cf2 Voir Dire Analyst transforms jury selection from a paper-and-instinct process into a structured, AI-augmented workflow. It handles the tedious parts\emdash parsing court documents, tracking responses, researching backgrounds\emdash so the attorney can focus on reading the room, asking the right questions, and making strategic decisions with better data than they have ever had at their fingertips during voir dire.}
\par

